## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **ResNet18** (not 50/101) | 18 layers is sufficient for wafer map complexity; deeper nets overfit on typical 5–50k datasets |
| **Focal Loss** (γ=2.0) | Down-weights easy/majority samples; normal wafers (45%+ of data) don't dominate the loss |
| **Lot-based split** | Wafers in the same lot share process conditions — random split causes data leakage |
| **Single WaferPreprocessor** | Shared between training and inference to guarantee preprocessing parity |
| **No elastic distortion** | Could create/destroy defect patterns, violating class semantics |

