## How to Use

**Train the model:**

```powershell
python training/train_resnet.py                      # full training (15 epochs, 3000 samples)
python training/train_resnet.py --epochs 5 --n-samples 500  # quick test
```

**Run inference:**

```python
from deployment.inference import WaferInferenceEngine
engine = WaferInferenceEngine()
result = engine.predict_from_array(wafer_image)
# result = {predicted_class, confidence, class_probabilities, heatmap, overlay}
```

**Launch Streamlit dashboard:**

```powershell
streamlit run deployment/streamlit_app_v2.py
```
